+## Latest Release: 0.24.5 Beta
+
+* Torn Companion pairs through an authenticated BOSBOT approval page. Each browser receives a revocable read-only credential scoped to its account/server; provider keys and website cookies stay on the server.
+* `/api/extension/snapshot` serves war scores, chain, recommended targets, hospital timers, personal travel and abroad stocks using shared BOSBOT caches. Existing page/Discord permissions apply to every read.
+* The extension preserves BOSBOT ranking and reasons, removes level-based battle-stat fallbacks and uses unknown for absent data. Restock windows stay estimated; provider timestamps remain visible.
+* Browser connections expire after 30 days. Approve via `/extension/connect` and manage/revoke at `/extension/devices`. Chrome favorites/layout remain local; importing favorites does not change Discord subscriptions.
+* Server/device/provider tests: `.venv/bin/python -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_*.py'`. See `docs/browser-extension-integration.md` for protocol, deployment and account acceptance.
+
+## Previous Release: 0.24.4 Beta
 
 * Feedback keeps a stable form reference across the asynchronous save, prevents duplicate submits and retains drafts on failed sends. A later inbox refresh failure cannot turn a saved ticket into a failed-send message. Admin navigation routes personal Feedback to Feedback Inbox, including saved shortcuts; members retain their private submission history.
 * Admins configure **Restock Center → Discord channel** independently of personal favorites/DMs. Modes: important (Xanax, plushies, flowers), exact checked products (up to five per country), or highest estimated positive unit profit (one to five per country, configurable minimum). The existing channels/roles remain in use.
